&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MUSE&lt;/strong&gt; by Khadlaj — 100 ML EDP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refined elegance in every spray. Muse opens with the radiant freshness of bergamot and delicate orange blossom, complemented by the soft nutty richness of almond. The heart unfolds into elegant orris, jasmine, and a smooth cream accord — velvety and sophisticated. The base settles into creamy vanilla, tonka bean, glowing amber, and clean white musk — comforting, lasting, and effortlessly alluring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fragrance Notes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Top: Bergamot, Orange Blossom, Almond&lt;br&gt;
Heart: Orris, Jasmine, Cream Accord&lt;br&gt;
Base: Vanilla, Tonka Bean, Amber, White Musk&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Size:&lt;/strong&gt; 100 ML &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Eau de Parfum &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;For:&lt;/strong&gt; Women&lt;/p&gt;
